# LF in every working copy, whatever core.autocrlf says: gofmt reports CRLF
# Go files as unformatted, a CRLF shebang breaks the pre-commit hook, and the
# protocol id is the SHA-256 of the YAML bytes (ADR-0004).
*.go              text eol=lf
.githooks/*       text eol=lf
eval/config/*.yaml text eol=lf
